## SECTION 6: RESPONSIVE DESIGN

### Q: "Mobile view looks wrong"
**A**:
1. Check viewport meta tag in `<head>`
2. Verify media queries are correct
3. Test on actual mobile device
4. Check browser zoom is 100%

**Quick Fix**:
```html
<!-- Ensure this is in <head> -->
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
```

---

### Q: "Hamburger menu not working"
**A**:
1. Check JavaScript is enabled
2. Verify menu toggle button exists
3. Check for JavaScript errors in console
4. Test on different browser

