## SECTION 11: QUICK DIAGNOSTICS

### Run Diagnostic Script
```bash
# Create diagnostic script
cat > diagnose.php << 'EOF'
<?php
echo "=== DIAGNOSTIC REPORT ===\n\n";

// PHP Version
echo "PHP Version: " . phpversion() . "\n";

// Extensions
echo "MySQL Extension: " . (extension_loaded('mysqli') ? 'Yes' : 'No') . "\n";
echo "PDO Extension: " . (extension_loaded('pdo') ? 'Yes' : 'No') . "\n";

// Database Connection
try {
    $pdo = new PDO('mysql:host=localhost', 'root', '');
    echo "Database Connection: OK\n";
} catch (Exception $e) {
    echo "Database Connection: FAILED - " . $e->getMessage() . "\n";
}

// File Permissions
echo "\nFile Permissions:\n";
echo "config/: " . substr(sprintf('%o', fileperms('config')), -4) . "\n";
echo "php/: " . substr(sprintf('%o', fileperms('php')), -4) . "\n";
echo "assets/: " . substr(sprintf('%o', fileperms('assets')), -4) . "\n";

// Disk Space
echo "\nDisk Space:\n";
echo "Free: " . round(disk_free_space('/') / 1024 / 1024 / 1024, 2) . " GB\n";
echo "Total: " . round(disk_total_space('/') / 1024 / 1024 / 1024, 2) . " GB\n";

echo "\n=== END REPORT ===\n";
?>
EOF

# Run it
php diagnose.php
```

